    "detailed_description": "Other Realms: Dwarves &amp; more Dwarves is a dwarf based survival multiplayer game. Craft and build your kingdom piece by piece for your dwarves. Set foundations, forge devices and conquer your dwarven realm. Mine some stone, setup a base and secure it with turrets. Grab some mates and start building with your dwarves!<br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Full 3D open world environment with a vast range of resources to mine from for your dwarf!<br></li><li> Integrated build system, allows you to place foundations and objects for your dwarves<br></li><li> Full tier building system, including building from diamonds and crystal<br></li><li> Monsters such as golems so your dwarves can smash them up!<br></li><li> A variety of dwarven technology recipes to build from</li></ul>Did you enjoy playing Other Realms: Dwarves &amp; more Dwarves? Join our discord channel and chat about anything dwarf related today!",
